{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SwooshMania</strong> is a fast-paced 3D time-trial racing game where precision, reflexes, and momentum are everything. Dash, jump, dodge, and transform through obstacle-packed tracks to chase the fastest time and climb the global leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Rush</strong> \u2013 Experience tight, responsive controls and adrenaline-pumping action from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Hazards</strong> \u2013 Outsmart bouncing pillars, spike cubes, and crumbling platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete with players around the world. Every millisecond counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal Look, Maximum Focus</strong> \u2013 Clean visuals keep your eyes on the track and your mind in the zone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re the fastest?<br><strong>Run. Dodge. Fly. Win.</strong><br>Step into the world of <strong>SwooshMania</strong> and make your mark.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560590?t=1749465037","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560590/647786aa6892883b1f2aa7daa88403dcbec60132/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749465037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560590/fb1c8f86a3a9609b435c5c02312cf41b57985ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749465037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560590/fb1c8f86a3a9609b435c5c02312cf41b57985ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749465037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids